<title>USA: La Quinta sets $10 mln stock buyback.</title>
<headline>La Quinta sets $10 mln stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>La Quinta Inns Inc said Thursday it had authorized the repurchase of up to $10 million of its common stock.</p>
<p>The repurchases would be made from time to time in the open market or in private transactions as deemed appropriate by the company.</p>
<p>Repurchased shares will become treasury shares, it said.</p>
</text>
